{
  "_doc": "Tuned BETWEEN fights, never during. thresholds = trigger levels; rules = weight (higher fires first), condition name (state_rules.py CONDITIONS), bundles = kit short names (cd_plan.py ACTIONS) tried in order. First legal bundle of the top fired rule is FIRE, next legal one is BACKUP. 'profiles' override thresholds/weights/bundles per opponent.",
  "thresholds": {
